    title: "scala: the external METHOD-call branch hand-rolls Edge.create instead of make_unresolved_edge, losing the ADR-0036 lossless callee_name home and ADR-0037 dst_ref derivation"  # 5ccf
    status: todo_hard  # 5ccf
